
This folder contains isoconfigurational averages and model predictions of the KA2D system, separated into training and test set.

The ".tar.xz" file contains data in the numpy .npz format. 

-----------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------

T0.30:

The format of the files is: N1290T0.30_{STRUCT}.npz where STRUCT denotes the index of the structure (1 - 3000).

Each array contains the following information:

types: the type of each particle (1,2,3)
initial_positions: the initial positions of each particle in the structure
initial_positions_inherent: the initial positions in the inherent states of each particle in the structure
initial_positions_cage: the initial positions in the cage states of each particle in the structure (only for structures 1 - 300 (training) and 1501 - 1800 (test))
BOTAN: predictions of BOTAN (only for structures 1501 - 1600, only for type A particles)
CAGE: predictions of CAGE (only for structures 1501 - 1600, only for type A particles)
GlassMLP: predictions of GlassMLP (only for structures 1501 - 1600, only for type A particles)
SE3: predictions of SE3 (only for structures 1501 - 1600, only for type A particles)
DEN: Coarse-grained density (only for structures 1501 - 1600, only for type A particles)
EPOT: Coarse-grained potential energy in the inherent states (only for structures 1501 - 1600, only for type A particles)
TT: Coarse-grained Tong and Tanaka's Theta (only for structures 1501 - 1600, only for type A particles)
PSI4: Coarse-grained bond-order parameters Psi_4 (only for structures 1501 - 1600, only for type A particles)

-----------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------

T0.23:

The format of the files is: N1290T0.23_{STRUCT}.npz where STRUCT denotes the index of the structure (1 - 300).

Each array contains the following information:

types: the type of each particle (1,2,3)
initial_positions: the initial positions of each particle in the structure
initial_positions_inherent: the initial positions in the inherent states of each particle in the structure
initial_positions_cage: the initial positions in the cage states of each particle in the structure (only for structures 1 - 100 (training) and 151 - 251 (test))
GlassMLP: predictions of GlassMLP (only for structures 151 - 300, only for type A particles)

-----------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------

example.py: Creates a snapshot of an exemplary configuration and colors each particle according to its propensity


